name\":\"deployName\"},\"ghjuk258jq0\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"ghjuk258jq0\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"size\":\"small\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"height\":\"20px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"padding\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"\",\"x-index\":6,\"default\":\"-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"}}},\"form\":{\"wrapperCol\":12,\"labelCol\":6}}', '该模板演示基于 Java + Docker 实现全自动检出代码 -> 单元测试 -> 构建 Docker 镜像 -> 推送到 Docker 制品库 -> 部署到云端服务器,主要子步骤包括：gitClone, codeBuild, shCommand, imageBuild, k8sApplicationDeploy，这里介绍用法和入参含义。\n\n1  **代码克隆（gitClone）**\n    代码克隆子步骤可以选择从内部仓库（type==1）或者是外部仓库（type==2）克隆代码到流水线执行；\n    从内部仓库克隆时，需要填写服务器ID （gitServerId），仓库ID（gitGitLabId），和分支名称（branch2）\n    如果是从外部仓库克隆，除了需要代码http地址（gitUrl）和分支（branch1），还需要账号名（gitUser）和密码（password），以下是完整的子步骤代码：\n```\n/**\n * 定义一个可以本地使用的\n */\ndef call(String stepName,String type,String gitUrl,String gitUser,String password,String branch1,String gitServerId ,String gitGitLabId,String branch2){\n    echo \"代码克隆\"\n    if(gitServerId == \'\'){\n        gitServerId = \'2274147683644780544\'\n    }\n    def branch = branch1\n    def credentialsId = \"3d07ff58-2cd4-4939-b119-f44c32a6f7b6\"\n    if( type == \'1\'){\n        gitUrl = gitGitLabId.split(\"\\\\|\")[1]\n        branch = branch2\n    }else{\n        //根据用户名、密码和jobId来动态查询凭证id\n        def response = sh(returnStdout: true ,script: \"\"\"\n        curl -X GET \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/deploy/credentials/gitCredentialsId?jobId=${env.job_id}&gitUserName=${gitUser}&gitPassword=${password}\" -H \"accept: */*\"\n        \"\"\")\n        def resData = readJSON text: \"\"\"${response}\"\"\"\n        credentialsId = resData.data\n    }\n    echo \"${gitUrl}\"\n    echo \"${branch}\"\n    checkout([$class: \"GitSCM\",\n              branches: [[name: branch]],\n              extensions: [[\n                                   $class: \'CloneOption\',\n                                   shallow: true,\n                                   depth:   1,\n                                   timeout: 30\n                           ]],\n              userRemoteConfigs: [[\n                                          credentialsId: credentialsId,\n                                          url: gitUrl\n                                  ]]])\n    //通知流水线serviceId、gitlabId、commitId\n    if(type == \'1\'){\n        def commitId = sh(returnStdout: true ,script: \'git rev-parse --verify HEAD\').replaceAll(\"\\\\s+\", \"\")\n        env.gitCommitId = commitId\n        gitGitLabId = gitGitLabId.split(\"\\\\|\")[0]\n        sh \"\"\"\n        curl -X POST \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/devops/pipeline/${env.job_id}/${env.BUILD_NUMBER}/commitId?serverId=${gitServerId}&gitLabId=${gitGitLabId}&branch=${branch}&commitId=${commitId}&gitRepo=${gitUrl}\" -H \"accept: */*\" -d \"\" \n        \"\"\"\n        env.gitLabId = gitGitLabId\n\n    }\n    env.gitRepo = gitUrl\n\n}\n\n```\n2 **代码构建（codeBuild）**\n    构建代码时，可以选择不同的语言版本（language），不同的构建工具（buildTool），以满足不同代码构建环境需求，最后输入代码构建指令（buildCommand），具体子步骤代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String language,String buildTool,String buildCommand){\n    echo \"${buildCommand}\"\n    retry(3) {\n        sh \"\"\"\n        ${buildCommand}\n         \"\"\"\n    }\n}\n```\n3 **单元测试（shCommand）** \n这里选择可以执行任意shell脚本的shell命令子步骤来实现单元测试，需要手动输入自定义单元测试指令，例如“mvn test”，\n```\ndef call(String  stepName,String command) {\n    println(\"---${command}----\")\n    sh \"\"\"\n    ${command}\n    \"\"\"\n}\n```\n4 **构建 Docker 镜像（imageBuild）**\n    此子步骤将步骤2构建完成的代码，通过dockerfile制作成docker镜像，因此代码根目录需要提供相对应的Dockerfile，若没有提供，子步骤将使用如下默认Dockerfile：\n```\nFROM openjdk:8\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY target/*.jar ./app.jar\nENTRYPOINT [\"java\", \"-jar\",\"/app/app.jar\"]\n```\n镜像构建子步骤主要参数包括：harbor地址（harborUrl），自定义镜像名称（imageName），dockerfile文件名（dockerfile）,镜像标签名（tagert），具体代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String harborUrl,String imageName,String dockerfile,String tagert){\n    if(!fileExists(dockerfile)){\n        def language= params.language\n        println(\"-------------\"+language)\n        if(language == \'java8\' ||  language == \'java\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM openjdk:8\\nWORKDIR /app\\nCOPY target/*.jar ./app.jar\\nENTRYPOINT [\"java\", \"-jar\",\"/app/app.jar\"]\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else if(language == \'java11\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM openjdk:11\\nWORKDIR /app\\nCOPY target/*.jar ./app.jar\\nENTRYPOINT [\"java\", \"-jar\",\"/app/app.jar\"]\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else if(language == \'node14\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM node:14.16\\nWORKDIR /app\\nCOPY dist/ ./dist/\\nENTRYPOINT npm run entrypoint\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else if(language == \'net5\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/runtime:3.1.31-buster-slim\\nWORKDIR /app\\nCOPY app/build/ ./\\nENTRYPOINT [\"dotnet\", \"dotnetWebDemo.dll\"]\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else if(language == \'php7\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM php:7.4.33-cli-bullseye\\nWORKDIR /app\\nCOPY ./ ./\\nRUN composer install\\nCMD [\"php\", \"-S 0.0.0.0:80\", \"-t ./\"]\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else if(language == \'golang1.19\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM golang:1.19-bullseye\\nUSER root\\nWORKDIR /home/go\\nCOPY ./ ./\\nENTRYPOINT [\"./go-app\"]\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else if(language == \'python3\'){\n            sh \"\"\"\n            echo -e \"FROM python:3.8-bullseye\\nUSER root\\nWORKDIR /home/python\\nCOPY dist/ ./dist/\" > Dockerfile\n            \"\"\"\n        }else{\n            error \"error\"\n        }\n    }\n    sh \"docker build -f ${dockerfile} -t ${harborUrl}/${imageName}:${tagert} .\"\n    withCredentials([usernamePassword(credentialsId: \"harbor-pipeline-credentials\",passwordVariable: \'password\', usernameVariable: \'username\')]) {\n        sh \"docker login -u ${username} -p ${password} ${harborUrl}\"\n    }\n    retry(3) {\n        sh \"docker push ${harborUrl}/${imageName}:${tagert}\"\n    }\n    sh \"docker rmi -f ${harborUrl}/${imageName}:${tagert}\"\n\n    env.harborUrl = harborUrl\n    env.imageName = imageName\n    env.tagert = tagert\n}\n```\n5 **部署到云端**\n将构建完成的Docker部署到k8s集群上，在此步骤中，需要提供k8s的环境ID（envId）、部署集群ID（clusterId）、命名空间（namespace）和deployment，具体代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String envId,String clusterId,String namespace,String deployment){\n    //根据clusterId查询环境url和token\n    def response = sh returnStdout: true ,script:\"\"\"\n    curl -X GET \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/deploy/cluster/${clusterId}/token\" -H \"accept: */*\"\n    \"\"\"\n    def resData = readJSON text: \"\"\"${response}\"\"\"\n    \n    sh \"\"\"\n        kubectl config set-cluster kubernetes --server=https://${resData.data[0].ip}:${resData.data[0].port} --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true\n        set +x\n        kubectl config set-credentials admin --token=${resData.data[0].token}\n        set -x\n        kubectl config set-context dev --cluster=kubernetes --user=admin\n        kubectl config use-context dev\n    \"\"\"\n    if(env.imageName) {\n        def res = sh returnStdout: true, script: \"\"\"  \n        kubectl set image deployment ${deployment} *=${env.harborUrl}/${env.imageName}:${env.tagert} -n ${namespace}       \n        \"\"\"\n        if (!res.contains(\"update\")) {\n            sh \"kubectl rollout restart deployment ${deployment} -n ${namespace}\"\n        } else {\n            sh \"kubectl rollout restart deployment ${deployment} -n ${namespace}\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n```\n');
INSERT INTO `devops_jenkinsfile_template` VALUES (3, 'Java+虚拟机', '{\"pipeline\":{\"agent\":{\"type\":\"kubernetes\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${env.runCluster}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"cloud\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"maven\"},\"key\":\"defaultContainer\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\\napiVersion: v1\\nkind: Pod\\nspec:\\n  containers:\\n  - name: jnlp\\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\\n    image: ${env.inboundImage}\\n  - name: maven\\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\\n    image: ${env.agentImage}\\n    command:\\n    - sleep\\n    args:\\n    - 99d\\n    resources:\\n      requests:\\n        cpu: \\\"100m\\\"\\n        memory: \\\"100Mi\\\"\\n      limits:\\n        cpu: \\\"4000m\\\"\\n        memory: \\\"8192Mi\\\"\\n    volumeMounts:\\n      - mountPath: \\\"/var/run/docker.sock\\\"\\n        name: \\\"volume-1\\\"\\n        readOnly: false\\n      - mountPath: /root/.m2/settings.xml\\n        name: config\\n        subPath: settings.xml\\n  volumes:\\n    - hostPath:\\n        path: \\\"/var/run/docker.sock\\\"\\n      name: \\\"volume-1\\\"\\n    - configMap:\\n        items:\\n        - key: settings.xml\\n          path: settings.xml\\n        name: jenkins-agent-config\\n      name: config\\n\"},\"key\":\"yaml\"}]},\"stages\":[{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"代码克隆\",\"name\":\"gitClone\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码克隆\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"1\"},\"key\":\"serviceType\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"gitUrl\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"gitCredentialId\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"1\"},\"key\":\"serverId\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"9|http://10.10.103.230:32480/devops-config/config.git\"},\"key\":\"gitlabId\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"branch\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${branch}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_branch\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"选择已有\"},\"key\":\"dmkl_btn1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"dmkl_btn_1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"gitPath\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码克隆\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"代码克隆\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"代码构建\",\"name\":\"codeBuild\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码构建\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"java8\"},\"key\":\"language\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"maven3.5\"},\"key\":\"buildTool\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"mvn package\\n\"},\"key\":\"command\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"构建编译\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"构建编译\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"单元测试\",\"name\":\"shCommand\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"单元测试\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"mvn test\\n\"},\"key\":\"shCommand\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"单元测试\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"单元测试\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"通用制品上传\",\"name\":\"universalProductUploadFun\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"通用制品上传\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"rawRepository\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${rawRepository}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_rawRepository\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"tyzpsc_btn_1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"选择已有\"},\"key\":\"tyzpsc_btn1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"version\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"str_version\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${version}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_version\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"tyzpsc_btn_2\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"直接输入\"},\"key\":\"tyzpsc_btn2\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"target/*.jar\"},\"key\":\"file\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"productName\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"推送到制品仓库\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"推送到制品仓库\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"主机部署\",\"name\":\"hostDeployFun_v1\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"主机部署\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"deployEnv\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${deployEnv}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_deployEnv\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"zjbs_btn_1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"deployHost\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${deployHost}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_deployHost\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"zjbs_btn_2\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":false},\"key\":\"fileFlag\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"1\"},\"key\":\"fileSource\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"rawRepository\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_rawRepository\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"zjbs_btn_3\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"version\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"str_version\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_version\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"zjbs_btn_4\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"rawDeployProduct\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_rawDeployProduct\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"zjbs_btn_5\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"from\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"to\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\"},\"key\":\"remote_command\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"部署到云端\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"部署到云端\"}]}}', 'pipeline {\n  agent {\n    kubernetes {\n      cloud \"${env.runCluster}\"\n      defaultContainer \'maven\'\n      yaml \'\'\'\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nspec:\n  containers:\n  - name: jnlp\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n    image: ${env.inboundImage}\n  - name: maven\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n    image: ${env.agentImage}\n    command:\n    - sleep\n    args:\n    - 99d\n    resources:\n      requests:\n        cpu: \"100m\"\n        memory: \"100Mi\"\n      limits:\n        cpu: \"4000m\"\n        memory: \"8192Mi\"\n    volumeMounts:\n      - mountPath: \"/var/run/docker.sock\"\n        name: \"volume-1\"\n        readOnly: false\n      - mountPath: /root/.m2/settings.xml\n        name: config\n        subPath: settings.xml\n  volumes:\n    - hostPath:\n        path: \"/var/run/docker.sock\"\n      name: \"volume-1\"\n    - configMap:\n        items:\n        - key: settings.xml\n          path: settings.xml\n        name: jenkins-agent-config\n      name: config\n\'\'\'\n    }\n\n  }\n  stages {\n    stage(\'代码克隆\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'代码克隆\'\n      }\n      steps {\n        gitClone(stepName: \'代码克隆\', serviceType: \'1\', gitUrl: \'\', gitCredentialId: \'\', serverId: \'1\', gitlabId: \'9|http://10.10.103.230:32480/devops-config/config.git\', branch: \'\', startParamName_branch: \"${branch}\", dmkl_btn1: \'选择已有\', dmkl_btn_1: true, gitPath: \'\')\n      }\n    }\n\n    stage(\'构建编译\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'构建编译\'\n      }\n      step