"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"},\"8cfifqhln23\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"8cfifqhln23\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"fullness\":false,\"bordered\":false,\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"colon\":false,\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"display\":\"block\",\"fontWeight\":800,\"height\":\"40px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"height\":\"0%\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"代码构建\",\"x-index\":7,\"default\":\"\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"},\"from\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"ysqmxw3x4rj\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"tooltip\":\"需要上传文件到主机时，填写文件所在路径\",\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"description\":\"\",\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"文件本地路径\",\"x-index\":15,\"required\":false,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"from\"},\"to\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"wlz3s1c4vy1\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"description\":\"\",\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"上传到主机路径\",\"x-index\":16,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"to\"},\"gitUrl\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"0lq86d9jpyp\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"GIT仓库\",\"x-index\":2,\"required\":true,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"gitUrl\",\"x-reactions\":{\"fulfill\":{\"state\":{\"visible\":\"{{$deps.serviceType === \'2\'}}\"}},\"dependencies\":[{\"source\":\"serviceType\",\"type\":\"any\",\"property\":\"value\",\"name\":\"serviceType\"}]}},\"ghjuk258jq0\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"ghjuk258jq0\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"size\":\"small\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"height\":\"20px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"padding\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"\",\"x-index\":6,\"default\":\"-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"}}},\"form\":{\"wrapperCol\":12,\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"labelCol\":6}}', '\n该模板演示基于 Java + 虚拟机 实现全自动检出代码 -> 构建编译 -> 单元测试 -> 推送到 Maven 制品库 -> 部署到云端服务器,主要子步骤包括：gitClone, codeBuild, shCommand, mavenProductUpload, hostDeploy，这里介绍用法和入参含义。\n\n1  **代码克隆（gitClone）**\n    代码克隆子步骤可以选择从内部仓库（type==1）或者是外部仓库（type==2）克隆代码到流水线执行；\n    从内部仓库克隆时，需要填写服务器ID （gitServerId），仓库ID（gitGitLabId），和分支名称（branch2）\n    如果是从外部仓库克隆，除了需要代码http地址（gitUrl）和分支（branch1），还需要账号名（gitUser）和密码（password），以下是完整的子步骤代码：\n```\n/**\n * 定义一个可以本地使用的\n */\ndef call(String stepName,String type,String gitUrl,String gitUser,String password,String branch1,String gitServerId ,String gitGitLabId,String branch2){\n    echo \"代码克隆\"\n    if(gitServerId == \'\'){\n        gitServerId = \'2274147683644780544\'\n    }\n    def branch = branch1\n    def credentialsId = \"3d07ff58-2cd4-4939-b119-f44c32a6f7b6\"\n    if( type == \'1\'){\n        gitUrl = gitGitLabId.split(\"\\\\|\")[1]\n        branch = branch2\n    }else{\n        //根据用户名、密码和jobId来动态查询凭证id\n        def response = sh(returnStdout: true ,script: \"\"\"\n        curl -X GET \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/deploy/credentials/gitCredentialsId?jobId=${env.job_id}&gitUserName=${gitUser}&gitPassword=${password}\" -H \"accept: */*\"\n        \"\"\")\n        def resData = readJSON text: \"\"\"${response}\"\"\"\n        credentialsId = resData.data\n    }\n    echo \"${gitUrl}\"\n    echo \"${branch}\"\n    checkout([$class: \"GitSCM\",\n              branches: [[name: branch]],\n              extensions: [[\n                                   $class: \'CloneOption\',\n                                   shallow: true,\n                                   depth:   1,\n                                   timeout: 30\n                           ]],\n              userRemoteConfigs: [[\n                                          credentialsId: credentialsId,\n                                          url: gitUrl\n                                  ]]])\n    //通知流水线serviceId、gitlabId、commitId\n    if(type == \'1\'){\n        def commitId = sh(returnStdout: true ,script: \'git rev-parse --verify HEAD\').replaceAll(\"\\\\s+\", \"\")\n        env.gitCommitId = commitId\n        gitGitLabId = gitGitLabId.split(\"\\\\|\")[0]\n        sh \"\"\"\n        curl -X POST \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/devops/pipeline/${env.job_id}/${env.BUILD_NUMBER}/commitId?serverId=${gitServerId}&gitLabId=${gitGitLabId}&branch=${branch}&commitId=${commitId}&gitRepo=${gitUrl}\" -H \"accept: */*\" -d \"\" \n        \"\"\"\n        env.gitLabId = gitGitLabId\n\n    }\n    env.gitRepo = gitUrl\n\n}\n\n```\n2 **代码构建（codeBuild）**\n    构建代码时，可以选择不同的语言版本（language），不同的构建工具（buildTool），以满足不同代码构建环境需求，最后输入代码构建指令（buildCommand），具体子步骤代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String language,String buildTool,String buildCommand){\n    echo \"${buildCommand}\"\n    retry(3) {\n        sh \"\"\"\n        ${buildCommand}\n         \"\"\"\n    }\n}\n```\n3 **单元测试（shCommand）** \n这里选择可以执行任意shell脚本的shell命令子步骤来实现单元测试，需要手动输入自定义单元测试指令，例如“npm run test”\n```\ndef call(String  stepName,String command) {\n    println(\"---${command}----\")\n    sh \"\"\"\n    ${command}\n    \"\"\"\n}\n```\n\n4 **推送到制品仓库（mavenProductUpload）**\n在Java环境下，这里使用mvn制品上传子步骤，子步骤提供deploy和通用上传两种方式\ndeploy方式仅需提供制品仓库URL地址(nexusUrl)即可\n通用上传需要提供：制品仓库（nexusUrl），组织名（group），制品名（artifacts），版本号（version），包类型（packaging），类信息（Classfier），文件路径（path），这里可以选择是否生成pom文件（pom）,具体代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String type,String nexusUrl,String group,String artifacts,String version,\n         String packaging,String Classfier,boolean pom,String path){\n    nexusArr = nexusUrl.split(\"\\\\|\")\n    println(\"${nexusArr[1]}\")\n    if(type == \'1\'){\n        sh \"mvn deploy -DskipTests -DaltDeploymentRepository=public::default::${nexusArr[1]}\"\n    }else{\n        fileName = sh(returnStdout:true, script:\"ls ${path}/*.${packaging}\").trim()\n        classStr = \"\"\n        if(Classfier != \'\'){\n            classStr = \"-F \'assetClassifier=${Classfier}\'\"\n        }\n        sh\"\"\"\n            curl -X POST \'${env.repositorySvcUrl}/api/product/upload\' -H  \'accept: */*\' \\\n             -H  \'Content-Type: multipart/form-data\' -F \'packaging=${packaging}\' \\\n             -F \'repositoryId=${nexusArr[0]}\' -F \'imageName=\' -F \'directory=\' -F \'artifactId=${artifacts}\'  \\\n              ${classStr} -F \'assetFilename=\' -F \'files=@${fileName} \\\n             -F \'version=${version}\' -F \'generatePom=true\' -F \'groupId=${group}\' -F \'imageTag=\'\'\n          \"\"\"\n    }\n}\n```\n5 **部署到云端**\n主机部署时，需要提供环境ID（envId），主机ID（hostId），本地路径（from），远程路径（to）和相对应的ssh命令（command），具体代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,int envId,int hostId,String from ,String to,String command){\n    echo \"---${from}---${to}---${command}---\"\n    def response = sh returnStdout: true ,script:\"\"\"\n        curl -X GET \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/deploy/host/${hostId}/password\" -H \"accept: */*\"\n        \"\"\"\n    def resData = readJSON text: \"\"\"${response}\"\"\"\n    def remote = [name: \"remote\", host: resData.data.ip, port: resData.data.port, user: resData.data.credential.name, password: resData.data.credential.password, allowAnyHosts: true]\n\n    if(from != \'\'){\n        sshPut remote: remote, from: \"${from}\", into: \"${to}\"\n    }\n    arr = command.split(\"\\n\").join(\" ; \")\n\n    sshCommand remote: remote, command: \"\"\"${command}\"\"\"\n\n}\n```');
INSERT INTO `devops_jenkinsfile_template` VALUES (4, 'Node + Docker', '{\"pipeline\":{\"agent\":{\"type\":\"kubernetes\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${env.runCluster}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"cloud\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"maven\"},\"key\":\"defaultContainer\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\\napiVersion: v1\\nkind: Pod\\nspec:\\n  containers:\\n  - name: jnlp\\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\\n    image: ${env.inboundImage}\\n  - name: maven\\n    imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\\n    image: ${env.agentImage}\\n    command:\\n    - sleep\\n    args:\\n    - 99d\\n    resources:\\n      requests:\\n        cpu: \\\"100m\\\"\\n        memory: \\\"100Mi\\\"\\n      limits:\\n        cpu: \\\"4000m\\\"\\n        memory: \\\"8192Mi\\\"\\n    volumeMounts:\\n      - mountPath: \\\"/var/run/docker.sock\\\"\\n        name: \\\"volume-1\\\"\\n        readOnly: false\\n  volumes:\\n    - hostPath:\\n        path: \\\"/var/run/docker.sock\\\"\\n      name: \\\"volume-1\\\"\\n\"},\"key\":\"yaml\"}]},\"stages\":[{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"代码克隆\",\"name\":\"gitClone\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码克隆\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"1\"},\"key\":\"serviceType\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"gitUrl\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"gitCredentialId\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"1\"},\"key\":\"serverId\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"19|http://10.10.103.230:32480/userinfo-20240203-81/java-demo-20240203-81.git\"},\"key\":\"gitlabId\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"branch\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${branch}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_branch\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"选择已有\"},\"key\":\"dmkl_btn1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"dmkl_btn_1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\"},\"key\":\"gitPath\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码克隆\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"代码克隆\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"代码构建\",\"name\":\"codeBuild\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码构建\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"node14\"},\"key\":\"language\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"npm install\\nnpm run build\"},\"key\":\"command\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码构建\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"代码构建\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"单元测试\",\"name\":\"shCommand\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"单元测试\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"npm test\\n\"},\"key\":\"shCommand\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"单元测试\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"单元测试\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"镜像构建\",\"name\":\"imageBuild\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"镜像构建\"},\"key\":\"stepName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${dockerRepository}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"startParamName_dockerRepository\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"设置为定值\"},\"key\":\"jxgj_btn1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":true},\"key\":\"jxgj_btn_1\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"Dockerfile\"},\"key\":\"dockerfile\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"amd64\"},\"key\":\"platform\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"app\"},\"key\":\"imageName\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"defin\"},\"key\":\"tagType\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${tag}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"params_tag\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"构建Docker镜像\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"构建Docker镜像\"},{\"