tring\",\"title\":\"文件本地路径\",\"x-index\":15,\"required\":false,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"from\"},\"to\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"wlz3s1c4vy1\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"description\":\"\",\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"上传到主机路径\",\"x-index\":16,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"to\"},\"gitUrl\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"0lq86d9jpyp\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"GIT仓库\",\"x-index\":2,\"required\":true,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"gitUrl\",\"x-reactions\":{\"fulfill\":{\"state\":{\"visible\":\"{{$deps.serviceType === \'2\'}}\"}},\"dependencies\":[{\"source\":\"serviceType\",\"type\":\"any\",\"property\":\"value\",\"name\":\"serviceType\"}]}},\"ociqlmrw4m3\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"ociqlmrw4m3\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"size\":\"small\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"height\":\"10px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"padding\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"\",\"x-index\":13,\"default\":\"-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"},\"ghjuk258jq0\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"ghjuk258jq0\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"size\":\"small\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"height\":\"20px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"padding\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"\",\"x-index\":6,\"default\":\"-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"}}},\"form\":{\"wrapperCol\":12,\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelCol\":6}}', '\n该模板演示基于 Node + 虚拟机 实现全自动检出代码 -> 构建编译 -> 单元测试 -> 推送到 Npm 制品库 -> 部署到云端服务器,主要子步骤包括：gitClone, codeBuild, shCommand, npmProductUpload, hostDeploy，这里介绍用法和入参含义。\n\n1  **代码克隆（gitClone）**\n    代码克隆子步骤可以选择从内部仓库（type==1）或者是外部仓库（type==2）克隆代码到流水线执行；\n    从内部仓库克隆时，需要填写服务器ID （gitServerId），仓库ID（gitGitLabId），和分支名称（branch2）\n    如果是从外部仓库克隆，除了需要代码http地址（gitUrl）和分支（branch1），还需要账号名（gitUser）和密码（password），以下是完整的子步骤代码：\n```\n/**\n * 定义一个可以本地使用的\n */\ndef call(String stepName,String type,String gitUrl,String gitUser,String password,String branch1,String gitServerId ,String gitGitLabId,String branch2){\n    echo \"代码克隆\"\n    if(gitServerId == \'\'){\n        gitServerId = \'2274147683644780544\'\n    }\n    def branch = branch1\n    def credentialsId = \"3d07ff58-2cd4-4939-b119-f44c32a6f7b6\"\n    if( type == \'1\'){\n        gitUrl = gitGitLabId.split(\"\\\\|\")[1]\n        branch = branch2\n    }else{\n        //根据用户名、密码和jobId来动态查询凭证id\n        def response = sh(returnStdout: true ,script: \"\"\"\n        curl -X GET \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/deploy/credentials/gitCredentialsId?jobId=${env.job_id}&gitUserName=${gitUser}&gitPassword=${password}\" -H \"accept: */*\"\n        \"\"\")\n        def resData = readJSON text: \"\"\"${response}\"\"\"\n        credentialsId = resData.data\n    }\n    echo \"${gitUrl}\"\n    echo \"${branch}\"\n    checkout([$class: \"GitSCM\",\n              branches: [[name: branch]],\n              extensions: [[\n                                   $class: \'CloneOption\',\n                                   shallow: true,\n                                   depth:   1,\n                                   timeout: 30\n                           ]],\n              userRemoteConfigs: [[\n                                          credentialsId: credentialsId,\n                                          url: gitUrl\n                                  ]]])\n    //通知流水线serviceId、gitlabId、commitId\n    if(type == \'1\'){\n        def commitId = sh(returnStdout: true ,script: \'git rev-parse --verify HEAD\').replaceAll(\"\\\\s+\", \"\")\n        env.gitCommitId = commitId\n        gitGitLabId = gitGitLabId.split(\"\\\\|\")[0]\n        sh \"\"\"\n        curl -X POST \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/devops/pipeline/${env.job_id}/${env.BUILD_NUMBER}/commitId?serverId=${gitServerId}&gitLabId=${gitGitLabId}&branch=${branch}&commitId=${commitId}&gitRepo=${gitUrl}\" -H \"accept: */*\" -d \"\" \n        \"\"\"\n        env.gitLabId = gitGitLabId\n\n    }\n    env.gitRepo = gitUrl\n\n}\n\n```\n2 **代码构建（codeBuild）**\n    构建代码时，可以选择不同的语言版本（language），不同的构建工具（buildTool），以满足不同代码构建环境需求，最后输入代码构建指令（buildCommand），具体子步骤代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String language,String buildTool,String buildCommand){\n    echo \"${buildCommand}\"\n    retry(3) {\n        sh \"\"\"\n        ${buildCommand}\n         \"\"\"\n    }\n}\n```\n3 **单元测试（shCommand）** \n这里选择可以执行任意shell脚本的shell命令子步骤来实现单元测试，需要手动输入自定义单元测试指令\n```\ndef call(String  stepName,String command) {\n    println(\"---${command}----\")\n    sh \"\"\"\n    ${command}\n    \"\"\"\n}\n```\n\n4 **推送到制品仓库（npmProductUpload）**\n在Node环境下，使用npm制品上传子步骤，仅需提供制品库ID（nexusRepo）即可,具体代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,String nexusRepo){\n    sh(script:\"npm pack\")\n    npmFileName = sh(returnStdout:true, script:\"ls *.tgz\").trim()\n    sh\"\"\"\n     curl -X POST \'${env.repositorySvcUrl}/api/product/upload\' -H  \'accept: */*\' \\\n    -H  \'Content-Type: multipart/form-data\' -F \'packaging=\' -F \'repositoryId=${nexusRepo}\' \\\n    -F \'imageName=\' -F \'directory=\' -F \'artifactId=\' -F \'assetClassifier=\' -F \'assetFilename=\' \\\n    -F \'files=@${npmFileName}\' -F \'version=\' -F \'generatePom=\' -F \'groupId=\' -F \'imageTag=\' \n    \"\"\"\n}\n```\n5 **部署到云端**\n主机部署时，需要提供环境ID（envId），主机ID（hostId），本地路径（from），远程路径（to）和相对应的ssh命令（command），具体代码如下：\n```\ndef call(String stepName,int envId,int hostId,String from ,String to,String command){\n    echo \"---${from}---${to}---${command}---\"\n    def response = sh returnStdout: true ,script:\"\"\"\n        curl -X GET \"${env.pipelineSvcUrl}/deploy/host/${hostId}/password\" -H \"accept: */*\"\n        \"\"\"\n    def resData = readJSON text: \"\"\"${response}\"\"\"\n    def remote = [name: \"remote\", host: resData.data.ip, port: resData.data.port, user: resData.data.credential.name, password: resData.data.credential.password, allowAnyHosts: true]\n\n    if(from != \'\'){\n        sshPut remote: remote, from: \"${from}\", into: \"${to}\"\n    }\n    arr = command.split(\"\\n\").join(\" ; \")\n\n    sshCommand remote: remote, command: \"\"\"${command}\"\"\"\n\n}\n```');
INSERT INTO `devops_jenkinsfile_template` VALUES (6, '.NET 5.0 + Docker', '{\"pipeline\":{\"agent\":{\"type\":\"kubernetes\",\"arguments\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":false,\"value\":\"\\\"${env.runCluster}\\\"\"},\"key\":\"cloud\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"maven\"},\"key\":\"defaultContainer\"},{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"\\napiVersion: v1\\nkind: Pod\\nspec:\\n  containers:\\n  - name: jnlp\\n    imagePullPolicy: Always\\n    image: ${env.inboundImage}\\n  - name: maven\\n    imagePullPolicy: Always\\n    image: ${env.agentImage}\\n    command:\\n    - sleep\\n    args:\\n    - 99d\\n    resources:\\n      requests:\\n        cpu: \\\"100m\\\"\\n        memory: \\\"100Mi\\\"\\n      limits:\\n        cpu: \\\"4000m\\\"\\n        memory: \\\"8192Mi\\\"\\n    volumeMounts:\\n      - mountPath: \\\"/root/.m2/repository\\\"\\n        name: \\\"volume-0\\\"\\n        readOnly: false\\n      - mountPath: \\\"/var/run/docker.sock\\\"\\n        name: \\\"volume-1\\\"\\n        readOnly: false\\n      - mountPath: /usr/local/apache-maven-3.6.2/conf/settings.bk\\n        name: config\\n        subPath: settings.xml\\n  volumes:\\n    - hostPath:\\n        path: \\\"/var/run/docker.sock\\\"\\n      name: \\\"volume-1\\\"\\n    - hostPath:\\n        path: \\\"/root/.m2/repository\\\"\\n      name: \\\"volume-0\\\"\\n    - configMap:\\n        items:\\n        - key: settings.xml\\n          path: settings.xml\\n        name: jenkins-agent-config\\n      name: config\\n\"},\"key\":\"yaml\"}]},\"stages\":[{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"代码克隆\",\"name\":\"gitClone\",\"arguments\":[{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码克隆\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[serviceType]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[git_repo]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[credentiail]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[branch_1]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[service_id]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[project_id]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[branch_2]\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码拉取\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"代码拉取\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"代码构建\",\"name\":\"codeBuild\",\"arguments\":[{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"代码构建\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[params_language]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[params_buildTool]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[command2]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[file_setting]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[null_settingContent]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[proxy]\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"项目构建\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"项目构建\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"单元测试\",\"name\":\"shCommand\",\"arguments\":[{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"单元测试\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"dotnet test\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"单元测试\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"单元测试\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"镜像构建\",\"name\":\"imageBuild\",\"arguments\":[{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"镜像构建\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[harborUrl]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[imageName]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"Dockerfile\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[tagType]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[tagert]\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"构建docker\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"构建docker\"},{\"branches\":[{\"steps\":[{\"stepName\":\"Kubernetes镜像更新\",\"name\":\"k8sApplicationDeploy\",\"arguments\":[{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"Kubernetes镜像更新\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[deployEnv]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[deployCluster]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[NAMESPACE]\"},{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"[appName]\"}]}],\"name\":\"default\"}],\"environment\":[{\"value\":{\"isLiteral\":true,\"value\":\"部署到云端\"},\"key\":\"stageName\"}],\"name\":\"部署到云端\"}]]', 'pipeline {\n  agent {\n    kubernetes {\n      cloud \"${env.runCluster}\"\n      defaultContainer \'maven\'\n      yaml \'\'\'\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nspec:\n  containers:\n  - name: jnlp\n    imagePullPolicy: Always\n    image: ${env.inboundImage}\n  - name: maven\n    imagePullPolicy: Always\n    image: ${env.agentImage}\n    command:\n    - sleep\n    args:\n    - 99d\n    resources:\n      requests:\n        cpu: \"100m\"\n        memory: \"100Mi\"\n      limits:\n        cpu: \"4000m\"\n        memory: \"8192Mi\"\n    volumeMounts:\n      - mountPath: \"/root/.m2/repository\"\n        name: \"volume-0\"\n        readOnly: false\n      - mountPath: \"/var/run/docker.sock\"\n        name: \"volume-1\"\n        readOnly: false\n      - mountPath: /usr/local/apache-maven-3.6.2/conf/settings.bk\n        name: config\n        subPath: settings.xml\n  volumes:\n    - hostPath:\n        path: \"/var/run/docker.sock\"\n      name: \"volume-1\"\n    - hostPath:\n        path: \"/root/.m2/repository\"\n      name: \"volume-0\"\n    - configMap:\n        items:\n        - key: settings.xml\n          path: settings.xml\n        name: jenkins-agent-config\n      name: config\n\'\'\'\n    }\n\n  }\n  stages {\n    stage(\'代码拉取\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'代码拉取\'\n      }\n      steps {\n        gitClone(\'代码克隆\', \'[serviceType]\', \'[git_repo]\', \'[credentiail]\', \'[branch_1]\', \'[service_id]\', \'[project_id]\', \'[branch_2]\')\n      }\n    }\n\n    stage(\'项目构建\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'项目构建\'\n      }\n      steps {\n        codeBuild(\'代码构建\', \'[params_language]\', \'[params_buildTool]\', \'[command2]\', \'[file_setting]\', \'[null_settingContent]\', \'[proxy]\')\n      }\n    }\n\n    stage(\'单元测试\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'单元测试\'\n      }\n      steps {\n        shCommand(\'单元测试\', \'dotnet test\')\n      }\n    }\n\n    stage(\'构建docker\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'构建docker\'\n      }\n      steps {\n        imageBuild(\'镜像构建\', \'[harborUrl]\', \'[imageName]\', \'Dockerfile\', \'[tagType]\', \'[tagert]\')\n      }\n    }\n\n    stage(\'部署到云端\') {\n      environment {\n        stageName = \'部署到云端\'\n      }\n      steps {\n        k8sApplicationDeploy(\'Kubernetes镜像更新\', \'[deployEnv]\', \'[deployCluster]\', \'[NAMESPACE]\', \'[appName]\')\n      }\n    }\n\n  }\n}', '[{\"defaultValue\":\"latest\",\"paramName\":\"tag\",\"type\":\"string\",\"showFlag\":true,\"trim\":false},{\"defaultValue\":\"main\",\"paramName\":\"branch\",\"type\":\"string\",\"showFlag\":true,\"trim\":false}]', '[{\"updateFlag\":true,\"paramName\":\"lanuage\",\"paramValue\":\"net5\"}]', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2022-11-14 16:19:11', '2023-05-29 09:35:31', NULL, 1, '该模板演示基于 .NET+ Docker 实现全自动检出代码 -> 单元测试 -> 构建 Docker 镜像 -> 推送到 Docker 制品库 -> 部署到云端服务器', '1', '{}', 'text_img', '{\"schema\":{\"x-designable-id\":\"buhqy3ub97h\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"e38uia797su\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"e38uia797su\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"fullness\":false,\"bordered\":false,\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"colon\":false,\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"display\":\"block\",\"fontWeight\":800,\"height\":\"40px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"height\":\"0%\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"代码库\",\"x-index\":0,\"default\":\"\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"},\"serviceType\":{\"x-component\":\"Select\",\"x-designable-id\":\"mnue2j6knv9\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"title\":\"代码库类型\",\"x-index\":1,\"enum\":[{\"label\":\"内部\",\"children\":[],\"value\":\"1\"},{\"label\":\"外部\",\"children\":[],\"value\":\"2\"}],\"default\":\"1\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"serviceType\",\"x-reactions\":{\"dependencies\":[{\"type\":\"any\",\"property\":\"value\"}]}},\"NAMESPACE\":{\"x-component\":\"Select\",\"x-designable-id\":\"su1jgw15r9p\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"title\":\"k8s命名空间\",\"x-index\":26,\"required\":true,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"NAMESPACE\",\"x-reactions\":{\"fulfill\":{\"run\":\"$effect(() => {\\n  if ($deps.deployCluster) {\\n    $self.loading = true\\n    // $self.value = \\\"\\\"\\n    var token = localStorage.getItem(\\\"userToken\\\")\\n    fetch(\\n      `${window.location.origin}/api/efficiency/deploy/cluster/${$deps.deployCluster}`,\\n      {\\n        headers: { Authorization: token },\\n      }\\n    )\\n      .then((response) => response.json())\\n      .then(\\n        ({ data }) => {\\n          if (data != null && data.length > 0) {\\n            var na = data[0].namespace\\n            const re = na.map((k) => ({\\n              ...k,\\n              value: k,\\n              label: k,\\n            }))\\n            $self.loading = false\\n            $self.dataSource = re\\n          } else {\\n            $self.dataSource = []\\n          }\\n        },\\n        () => {\\n          $self.loading = false\\n        }\\n      )\\n  }\\n}, [$deps.deployCluster])\\n\"},\"dependencies\":[{\"source\":\"deployCluster\",\"type\":\"any\",\"property\":\"value\",\"name\":\"deployCluster\"}]}},\"null_settingContent\":{\"x-component\":\"Input.TextArea\",\"x-designable-id\":\"ybivkz35v55\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"autoSize\":true},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"文件内容\",\"x-index\":14,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"null_settingContent\",\"x-reactions\":{\"fulfill\":{\"run\":\"$effect(() => {\\n  if ($deps.file_setting) {\\n    //console.log($deps.settingFile[0].response.data.link)\\n    var link = $deps.file_setting[0].response.data.link\\n    //var link = `http%3A%2F%2F10.10.102.202%3A33006%2Famp%2F1c8ffc057e6af27fe7dc8d096270be85.xml`\\n    if (link) {\\n      const org = sessionStorage.getItem(\\\"curOrg\\\") || \\\"{}\\\"\\n      var orgId = \\\"\\\"\\n      if (org != \\\"{}\\\") orgId = JSON.parse(org).organId || \\\"\\\"\\n      var token = localStorage.getItem(\\\"userToken\\\")\\n      fetch(\\n        `${window.location.origin}/api/efficiency/devops/pipeline/fileContent?url=${link}`,\\n        {\\n          headers: { \\\"Amp-Organ-Id\\\": orgId, Authorization: token },\\n        }\\n      )\\n        .then((response) => response.json())\\n        .then(\\n          ({ data }) => {\\n            $self.initialValue = data\\n          },\\n          () => {}\\n        )\\n    }\\n  }\\n}, [$deps.file_setting])\\n\",\"state\":{\"visible\":\"{{$deps.params_language.startsWith(\\\"java\\\")}}\"}},\"dependencies\":[{\"source\":\"params_language\",\"type\":\"any\",\"property\":\"value\",\"name\":\"params_language\"},{\"source\":\"file_setting\",\"type\":\"Array<object>\",\"property\":\"value\",\"name\":\"file_setting\"}]},\"x-pattern\":\"readOnly\"},\"svrextyjdxj\":{\"x-component\":\"Input\",\"x-designable-id\":\"svrextyjdxj\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"fullness\":false,\"bordered\":false,\"layout\":\"horizontal\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\",\"colon\":false,\"feedbackLayout\":\"terse\",\"style\":{\"margin\":\"0px 0px 0px 0px\",\"display\":\"block\",\"fontWeight\":800,\"height\":\"40px\"}},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{\"bordered\":false,\"style\":{\"height\":\"0%\"}},\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"镜像推送\",\"x-index\":17,\"default\":\"\",\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"x-pattern\":\"disabled\"},\"deployCluster\":{\"x-component\":\"Select\",\"x-designable-id\":\"su3n3oslt5q\",\"x-decorator-props\":{\"layout\":\"vertical\",\"labelAlign\":\"left\"},\"x-validator\":[],\"x-component-props\":{},\"title\":\"k8s集群\",\"x-index\":25,\"required\":true,\"x-decorator\":\"FormItem\",\"name\":\"deployCluster\",\"x-reactions\":{\"fulfill